---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Vigilo
    participant ControlDB as Control DB
    participant ExecutionDB as Execution DBs

    User->>Vigilo: vigilo run create
    activate Vigilo

    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Load and parse profile and dataset inputs
    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Canonicalize payloads and validate dataset
    Vigilo->>ControlDB: Validate profile executability
    ControlDB-->>Vigilo: Verified evaluator artifacts and ABI identities
    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Hash scoring policy, evaluator execution plan, and per-shard chunk membership

    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Plan case blobs, dataset version, run, chunks, and shard assignments
    Vigilo->>ControlDB: Commit creating run, routes, placement ledger, and exact chunk plan
    ControlDB-->>Vigilo: Durable run id and creation lease

    loop Each pending execution placement
        Vigilo->>ExecutionDB: Idempotently store prerequisites, hashed run snapshot, and owned chunks
        alt Seed transaction committed
            ExecutionDB-->>Vigilo: Placement seeded
            Vigilo->>ControlDB: Mark placement seeded
        else Retryable seed failure
            ExecutionDB-->>Vigilo: Seed not confirmed
            Vigilo->>ControlDB: Store error and next recovery time
        else Persisted data conflicts with plan
            ExecutionDB-->>Vigilo: Seed invariant error
            Vigilo->>ControlDB: Mark placement and run failed
        end
    end

    alt Every placement is seeded
        Vigilo->>ControlDB: Create dispatch cursors, set pending, and delete temporary chunk plan and retain membership hashes
        ControlDB-->>Vigilo: Run activated
        Vigilo-->>User: Pending run response
    else Creation remains retryable
        Vigilo-->>User: Creating run response with progress and run id
        Note over ControlDB: A coordinator claims the expired lease and resumes this run
    else Input validation or initial control commit fails
        ControlDB-->>Vigilo: Error
        Vigilo-->>User: Creation error without a durable run
    end

    deactivate Vigilo
